1. Authentication (User Routes)
Register User

Route: POST /api/users/register

Access: Public

Input (req.body): { "name": "...", "email": "...", "password": "..." }

Output (Response): { "_id": "...", "name": "...", "email": "...", "role": "member", "token": "eyJhbG..." }

Login User

Route: POST /api/users/login

Access: Public

Input (req.body): { "email": "...", "password": "..." }

Output (Response): { "_id": "...", "name": "...", "email": "...", "role": "member", "token": "eyJhbG..." }

2. Timetable (Lesson Routes)
Get All Lessons (Timetable)

Route: GET /api/lessons

Access: Public

Input: None

Output (Response): Array of objects [ { "_id": "...", "day": "Monday", "timeSlot": "09:00 AM", "exercise": { "name": "Yoga", "duration": 60 } } ]

3. Bookings (Member Routes)
Book a Lesson

Route: POST /api/bookings

Access: Private (Requires Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)

Input (req.body): { "lessonId": "..." }

Output (Response): { "message": "Class booked successfully", "booking": { ... } }

View My Bookings

Route: GET /api/bookings/my-bookings

Access: Private (Requires Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)

Input: None

Output (Response): Array of user's bookings [ { "_id": "...", "lesson": { "day": "...", "timeSlot": "...", "exercise": { "name": "..." } } } ]

4. Feedback (Review Routes)
Add a Review

Route: POST /api/reviews

Access: Private (Requires Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)

Input (req.body): { "lessonId": "...", "rating": 5, "comment": "Great class!" }

Output (Response): { "message": "Thank you! Your review has been submitted.", "review": { ... } }

5. Management (Admin Routes)
Get Attendance & Ratings Report

Route: GET /api/reports/attendance

Access: Admin Only (Requires Header: Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>)

Input: None

Output (Response): { "message": "Attendance and Rating Report", "report": [ { "lessonId": "...", "exerciseName": "Yoga", "schedule": "Monday - 09:00 AM", "totalMembersRegistered": 12, "averageRating": 4.5 } ] }
